@name     pattern_mute
@alias    ym
@group    seq
@c_name   skode_clause_pattern_mute
@type     immediate
@arity    1
@match    (finite)
@summary  mute or unmute pattern
@doc
Sets pattern mute state (0:unmute, 1:mute).
Usage: ym state (or pattern_mute state)
@code
    return skode_exec_ym(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
